## Test Suite Status

**Issue:** `npm test` exits with code 2 due to a **pre-existing cross-platform bug in `sw-code-review-test.sh:40`**:

```bash
sed -i '' "s|\$TEST_TEMP_DIR|$TEST_TEMP_DIR|g" ...
