The `-i ''` syntax is BSD sed (macOS), but the CI environment uses GNU sed (Linux). This is **unrelated to the session-restart feature** — it's a separate test harness issue in the code-review test file. The agent fixed one cross-platform bug (file_mtime in compat.sh) but missed this one.

